  "evidence": "TEXT_D: Massive NHS expansion and free personal care for the elderly; prevention and cleaner air/greener homes; carbon tax, 10% renewables, 60% recycling, protect green spaces, phase out nuclear; protect jury trial/right to silence, oppose ID cards; Equality Act and repeal Section 28; pro‑EU reform and euro entry by referendum. TEXT_F: Patient’s Guarantee with choice including private at NHS expense; better hospice funding; higher basic pension and tax reliefs for pensioners, protect homes/savings from care costs; restore Married Couple’s Allowance, champion families/faiths, access for religious broadcasters; tough on drugs and protect children online; more police, honesty in sentencing, parish constables, lifetime supervision for sex offenders, stronger school discipline; keep the pound, veto EU power transfers, NATO‑first defence, missile defence, nuclear deterrent, English votes for English laws; Can Work, Must Work and pay‑for‑outcomes employment programs; prisoners to work and pay reparations.",
